OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with taking boat from
OL,4,Aharbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with taking a
OL,7,Fboat without consent and causing more
OL,8,Fthan #5,000 worth of damage to it
OL,9,Fduring an incident in Ramsgate.
OL,11,FKent Police said it was called at about
OL,12,F03:15 GMT on Tuesday to a reported
OL,13,Ftheft in progress at Royal Harbour,
OL,14,Fwhich allegedly involved someone trying
OL,15,Fto take a fishing boat to sea.
OL,17,FBilal Adam, who police said lived in
OL,18,FLander Road in Greater Manchester, was
OL,19,Fcharged with a single count of
OL,20,Faggravated vehicle taking, which
OL,21,Fincluded vehicle damage of #5,000 or
OL,22,Fmore.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
